essage! 12:00:51 AM\n- textbox \"Type a message...\": Third message!\n- button \"Send\"<|\"|>}<tool_response|><|channel>thought\nNow send it.\n\n\n\n\n<channel|><|tool_call>call:browser_click{selector:<|\"|>button[type=\"submit\"]<|\"|>}<tool_call|><|tool_response>response:browser_click{value:<|\"|>Clicked 'button[type=\"submit\"]'.\nURL: http://localhost:5173/  TITLE: Real-time Message Board\nPAGE STRUCTURE:\n- heading \"Message Board\" [level=1]\n- text: Hello World! 12:00:47 AM Second message! 12:00:51 AM Third message! 12:00:57 AM\n- textbox \"Type a message...\"\n- button \"Send\"<|\"|>}<tool_response|><|channel>thought\nIt works! The third message appeared.\n\nWait, I should check if it appeared via SSE or via `fetchMessages`.\nActually, `fetchMessages` is called on load.\nIf I send a message, it should be sent via SSE.\n\nI'll try to simulate a second client (another tab) to see if SSE actually broadcasts.\nI'll use `browser_new_page`.\n\n\n\n\n<channel|><|tool_call>call:browser_new_page{url:<|\"|>http://localhost:5173/<|\"|>}<tool_call|><|tool_response>response:browser_new_page{value:<|\"|>Opened page-2 and navigated to http://localhost:5173/ [HTTP 200]\nURL: http://localhost:5173/  TITLE: Real-time Message Board\nOPEN PAGES: page-1 http://localhost:5173/ | page-2 (active) http://localhost:5173/\nPAGE STRUCTURE:\n- heading \"Message Board\" [level=1]\n- text: Hello World! 12:00:47 AM Second message! 12:00:51 AM Third message! 12:00:57 AM\n- textbox \"Type a message...\"\n- button \"Send\"<|\"|>}<tool_response|><|channel>thought\nNow in `page-1` (the first tab), I'll send a message.\nFirst, switch to `page-1`.\n\n\n\n\n\n<channel|><|tool_call>call:browser_switch_page{page:<|\"|>page-1<|\"|>}<tool_call|><|tool_response>response:browser_switch_page{value:<|\"|>Switched to page-1.\nURL: http://localhost:5173/  TITLE: Real-time Message Board\nOPEN PAGES: page-1 (active) http://localhost:5173/ | page-2 http://localhost:5173/\nPAGE STRUCTURE:\n- heading \"Message Board\" [level=1]\n- text: Hello World! 12:00:47 AM Second message! 12:00:51 AM Third message! 12:00:57 AM\n- textbox \"Type a message...\"\n- button \"Send\"<|\"|>}<tool_response|><|channel>thought\nSend message in `page-1`.\n\n\n\n\n\n<channel|><|tool_call>call:browser_type{selector:<|\"|>#message-input<|\"|>,text:<|\"|>Message from page 1!<|\"|>}<tool_call|><|tool_response>response:browser_type{value:<|\"|>Typed 'Message from page 1!' into '#message-input'.\nURL: http://localhost:5173/  TITLE: Real-time Message Board\nOPEN PAGES: page-1 (active) http://localhost:5173/ | page-2 http://localhost:5173/\nPAGE STRUCTURE:\n- heading \"Message Board\" [level=1]\n- text: Hello World! 12:00:47 AM Second message! 12:00:51 AM Third message! 12:00:57 AM\n- textbox \"Type a message...\": Message from page 1!\n- button \"Send\"<|\"|>}<tool_response|><|channel>thought\nNow click send in `page-1`.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<channel|><|tool_call>call:browser_click{selector:<|\"|>button[type=\"submit\"]<|\"|>}<tool_call|><|tool_response>response:browser_click{value:<|\"|>Clicked 'button[type=\"submit\"]'.\nURL: http://localhost:5173/  TITLE: Real-time Message Board\nOPEN PAGES: page-1 (active) http://localhost:5173/ | page-2 http://localhost:5173/\nPAGE STRUCTURE:\n- heading \"Message Board\" [level=1]\n- text: Hello World! 12:00:47 AM Second message! 12:00:51 AM Third message! 12:00:57 AM Message from page 1! 12:01:04 AM\n- textbox \"Type a message...\"\n- button \"Send\"<|\"|>}<tool_response|><|channel>thought\n","generated":""}
